After converting position of markers, I got the input format (mycross) like this:

first row marker name, second row chr name, third row is the marker position (Mbp/10^6, actually its physical location on chromosome) .

Then I run map_chr10 = est.map(mycross, chr = 10, error.prob = 0.01, maxit = 1000000000), and get this with summary(map_10):
